CORE smt-backend
main.c
--pointer-check --smt2
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
pointer outside object bounds.*FAILURE
--
The size of an object of infinite size simplified to an expression over
infinity: the bit-vector backend reported spurious bounds failures and the
SMT backend failed an invariant. Its size is now the largest value of the
size type.
